## One more on my own method

I hit the **same instrument error twice more** this pass: passing `--baseline` to a tool that takes
`--registry` and reading its usage error as a result, then reading `$?` after a pipe and getting
`tail`'s status instead of the guard's. Re-run correctly, the answer **inverted from 0 to 3** —
which was the entire finding. Fifth and sixth instances of the pattern. Hard rule adopted: **never
read an exit code through a pipe; check `--help` before using an unfamiliar flag.**

Box empty. Send the next batch whenever.

